{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toasts that stick together survive together. You can team up with up to 4 players.\u00a0 Split roles, share evidence, and help each other stay alive. You can also play solo if you\u2019re daring enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creepy Kitchens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Every kitchen is dark, tense, and full of surprises. Blenders rattle, ovens slam shut, and toasters ding when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Hunt across kitchens and diners. Each has unique layouts, cursed hiding spots, and enough spooky variety to keep you coming back for \u201cone more run.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haunted Appliances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Each round throws you into a new location where your job is to find haunted items and exorcise them. It could be anything from an old fridge to a crusty microwave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools to Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Use EMF readers, cameras, sound detectors, and other gear to track paranormal activity. Upgrade your equipment after each hunt to do a better job and be the least likely toast to get sliced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Again and Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Hunts change every time with random appliances and cursed objects. The more you play, the more gear and maps you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Choose your difficulty or dive into rotating challenges that change up the rules. Higher risk means scarier hunts and more rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868030?t=1760555536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868030?t=1760555536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868030/2a26d79d95063a190c49ae4257c1e2710f46330d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760555536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868030/2a26d79d95063a190c49ae4257c1e2710f46330d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760555536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toasts that stick together survive together. You can team up with up to 4 players.\u00a0 Split roles, share evidence, and help each other stay alive. You can also play solo if you\u2019re daring enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creepy Kitchens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Every kitchen is dark, tense, and full of surprises. Blenders rattle, ovens slam shut, and toasters ding when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Hunt across kitchens and diners. Each has unique layouts, cursed hiding spots, and enough spooky variety to keep you coming back for \u201cone more run.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haunted Appliances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Each round throws you into a new location where your job is to find haunted items and exorcise them. It could be anything from an old fridge to a crusty microwave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools to Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Use EMF readers, cameras, sound detectors, and other gear to track paranormal activity. Upgrade your equipment after each hunt to do a better job and be the least likely toast to get sliced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Again and Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Hunts change every time with random appliances and cursed objects. The more you play, the more gear and maps you unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Choose your difficulty or dive into rotating challenges that change up the rules. Higher risk means scarier hunts and more rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lucas Bj\u00f8rnsen"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868030/4b3388b6b29378357806c491d7caf8210ee10aff/header.jpg?t=1760555536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868030/269594137/4d791a8f1afb9b80fbb47b295f1567d5d50fe377/1760012284/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760555534","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868030/269594137/4d791a8f1afb9b80fbb47b295f1567d5d50fe377/1760012284/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760555534","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868030/269594137/4d791a8f1afb9b80fbb47b295f156